{"title":"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>When <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/5/e45574f3d5780d3cc3a54af71c9f53f092d5036c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 + 7 + 7^2 + \\cdots + 7^{2004}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"180\" height=\"16\" /> is divided by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/e/6ee927e1332358c96c62c277441c907c4f51057f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" />, a remainder of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> is obtained. Determine the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>By the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Geometric_series\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Geometric series\">geometric series</a> formula, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/2/392cf9e243d4035d4afd7a2da70dff22f1765c89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 + 7 + 7^2 + \\cdots + 7^{2004} = \\frac{7^{2005}-1}{7-1} = \\frac{7^{2005}-1}{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"371\" height=\"39\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/9/529a6f0b1c95dd55117d9cc377a9b67258d2c627.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\varphi(1000) = 400$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"113\" height=\"18\" />, by <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Fermat%27s_Little_Theorem\" title=\"Fermat&#39;s Little Theorem\">Fermat-Euler's Theorem</a>, this is equivalent to finding <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/c/44ce0f81cc78ff5cf704485d7bfb77c8dda9cebc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{7^{400 \\cdot 5 + 5} - 1}{6} \\equiv \\frac{7^5 - 1}{6} \\equiv \\boxed{801} \\pmod{1000}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"329\" height=\"39\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005\">Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems\">Problems</a></b>, <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/viewtopic.php?t=14769\">Source</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018035832\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.023 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.029 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 107/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1422/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 180/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1420/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    8.860      1 Template:Mock_AIME_box\n100.00%    8.860      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:6600:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018035832 and revision id 52974. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}